# =============================================================================
# MBC Database Backup - site inventory
# Spec: MBC-SPEC-BACKUP-001 v0.2, section 5.1 (survey of 31/07/2026)
#
# Deploy as /opt/mbc-backup/sites.conf  --  chmod 600, chown root:root
#
# Format: sitename|container_name|db_user|db_name
#
# - sitename is the backup key. File names and SharePoint folders are built
#   from it, NOT from the database name: two sites whose databases share a
#   name (e.g. both called master_product) would overwrite each other.
# - No passwords here. backup.sh reads POSTGRES_PASSWORD from the container
#   environment via `docker inspect` (see 5.1.1).
# - Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
# =============================================================================

marketplace_misa|manage_project_postgres|postgres|manage_project
skuapp|sku-postgres-1|skuapp|app_db
misa_sync_engine|misa_sync_db|postgres|misa_sync
mbc360|mbc360_app-postgres-1|mbc360|mbc360
mbc_tool_ads|mbc_tool_ads_postgres|postgres|tool_ads
timesheet_misa|time-tracking-postgres|postgres|time_tracking
mbc_ocr|max-biocare-ai-postgres-1|biocare|biocare
product_database|master_product_postgres|postgres|master_product
